# @hub-lanes

# ── LESSON-PROPOSE LANE (BH-5807, BH-5794.2) ───────────────────────────────
# Daily at 06:41 it reads the repeat BLOCK causes of the last 14 days
# (GET /api/lesson-propose/triggers), and for each category with 3 or more
# BLOCK verdicts drafts ONE fix: a plan-contract lesson or a build-discipline
# rule as a PR, or a check or a harness bug as an ai-build issue. The ledger
# (kind lesson_proposal) is read and claimed BEFORE the one model call
# (model_routes role lesson.propose); it never merges. flock -n dedupes.
# Off: LESSON_PROPOSE_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-lesson-propose, or
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off lesson-propose.
41 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/lesson-propose.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
